BaseConfigLib::initializeArbiter
├── given zero arbiters
│   └── it should return remaining data unchanged
├── given single arbiter
│   ├── it should add arbiter to storage set
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
├── given multiple arbiters
│   ├── it should add all arbiters to storage set
│   └── it should return remaining calldata
└── given extra data after arbiters
    └── it should return extra data as remaining